      "summary": {
        "unit_id": "hmh07-lua-follow6:153",
        "answer": "Takes menu f1_arg0, controller f1_arg1 and eight layout bounds f1_arg2..f1_arg9; calls LUI.UIHorizontalList.new and sets the literal class/id/sound. Creates a left-aligned horizontal list with spacing 6, a localized plus label and empty Attachment label. The Attachment setText CallOriginalFirst hook requests UpdateSelfState and RecalculateScaleToElementWidth in that order. Registers Hidden (not ElementHasText for Attachment) and HidePlus (literal true) predicates. Runs optional PreLoadFunc, then calls ReverseChildrenOrder only when IsCurrentLanguageReversed succeeds, then returns. There is no PostLoadFunc call in this selected body and no cross-file binding is inferred for the optional named hook. Exact child order: Plus, Attachment. All layout/property/asset values and each callback body are retained in the ordered trace. Returns self at the shown final return. Base/child lifetime, mode [excerpt; exact source record identified separately]",
        "unknowns": [
          "Effective HMH settings/data/assets, true load/overwrite/class lookup order, original recovered-text fidelity, native callback delivery and service/server implementations remain open.",
          "Independent correctness review and final game tests remain deferred."
